      "allwain vincula al pedido cambios relevantes de oferta, precio, pago, entrega, documentación e incidencia. La cronología técnica encadenada ayuda a detectar alteraciones y reconstruir lo ocurrido. No acredita por sí sola que un dato introducido sea verdadero y no es blockchain, acta notarial, firma cualificada ni sello de tiempo cualificado.": "allwain links relevant changes in offer, price, payment, delivery, documentation and incidents to the order. The chained technical chronology helps detect alterations and reconstruct what happened. By itself, it does not prove that entered data is true, and it is not a blockchain, notarial deed, qualified electronic signature or qualified electronic time stamp.",
