      "Antes de pagar se indicará si existe desistimiento, cómo ejercerlo, quién asume el coste de devolución y qué excepción concreta se aplica. Esto no elimina los derechos por producto defectuoso, inseguro, dañado o no conforme. El vendedor responde de la conformidad, seguridad e información del producto; quien transporta, de la custodia que haya aceptado; y ninguna condición limita derechos irrenunciables.": "Before payment, you will be told whether a right of withdrawal applies, how to exercise it, who bears the return cost and which specific exception applies. This does not remove rights relating to defective, unsafe, damaged or non-conforming products. The seller is responsible for product conformity, safety and information; the carrier is responsible for the custody they accepted; and no term limits rights that cannot legally be waived.",
      "Antes de una compra real se mostrará si el vendedor actúa como empresa/profesional o como particular, qué derechos de consumo se aplican y qué asumen vendedor, allwain y quien entrega. allwain responderá de sus funciones tecnológicas y de las ventas directas que identifique; no sustituye las obligaciones propias del vendedor.": "Before a real purchase, you will be shown whether the seller acts as a business/professional or as a private individual, which consumer rights apply, and the responsibilities of the seller, allwain and the person making the delivery. allwain is responsible for its technology functions and for direct sales identified as such; it does not replace the seller's own obligations.",
